      "message": "When `range.endContainer` is an ancestor container (such as `.lean-decl-card`, `.lean-body-section`, or `\u003ctable\u003e`) with `range.endOffset \u003e 0`, `prevChild` can be `.lean-body-section`, `.lean-code-lines`, or `\u003ctbody\u003e`. Because `TreeWalker.previousNode()` traverses in pre-order, starting `findPreviousInnerLineHost` at `prevChild` steps before `prevChild` without visiting its `[data-line]` descendants and falls back to `startEl`/`endCell`. Descending `prevChild` to its deepest `lastChild` first will resolve the last selected line in that subtree.",
